        {
          "name": "guard-service",
          "type": "patch"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Update dependencies\n\n- @rosen-bridge/abstract-scanner@4.0.0\n- @rosen-bridge/ergo-scanner@2.0.1\n- @rosen-bridge/evm-address-tx-extractor@4.0.0\n- @rosen-bridge/evm-scanner@2.0.1\n- @rosen-bridge/watcher-data-extractor@16.0.0",
      "id": "nine-cats-sort"
    },
    {
      "releases": [
        {
          "name": "@rosen-chains/handshake-rpc",
          "type": "patch"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Fix hsd compatibility issues in the Handshake RPC network:\n\n- raise failed RPC calls, which hsd reports with HTTP 200 and an `error` object in the body rather than with an error status\n- read the confirmation count from the `confirmations` field, as hsd does not report a `blockheight` for a transaction, which made every transaction look unconfirmed\n- stop converting the values of the `/coin/address` endpoint from HNS, as it already reports them in dollarydoos, which inflated address balances and box values by a factor of a million\n- exclude mempool coins from address boxes and assets, as hsd merges them into the `/coin/address` endpoint\n- never return a fee ratio below the relay minimum of one dollarydoo per virtual byte, as a node estimating under it produced transactions the network rejects as underpaying",
      "id": "olive-donkeys-shave"
    },
    {
      "releases": [
        {
          "name": "guard-service",
          "type": "patch"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Add bounded TSS signer adapters and a local digest authorization registry for\nexplicitly qualified signing consumers.",
      "id": "qualified-tss-authorization"
    },
    {
      "releases": [
        {
          "name": "@rosen-chains/base",
          "type": "minor"
